# JetBrains IDE settings
.idea/

# Local-only dev data: PC facts, logs, flagged clips, raw CSVs (see docs/PLAN.md §3.1)
.dogfood/

# Private notes that must never reach the public repo (e.g. trademark research)
.private/

# Rust build output (cargo, cargo-xwin), here and in docs/research/prototypes/*. Its dep-info and
# fingerprint files hold absolute paths with the Mac's account name, and "pc sync" must neither ship
# it nor make "git clean" on the PC delete the PC's build cache. Cargo.lock stays tracked.
target/
